      de: ["Part of the 'Virgin Komi Forests' UNESCO World Heritage site.", "Contains the largest continuous area of pristine virgin forest in Europe.", "Hosts the world's first experimental moose domestication farm (since 1949).", "Features the iconic Manpupuner rock formations, one of Russia's Seven Wonders.", "Located on the isolated western slopes of the remote Northern Ural Mountains.", "Provides critical, uninterrupted habitat for wild reindeer and brown bears.", "Spans over 7,200 square kilometers of deep taiga and high mountain tundra."],
